<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>API Documentation | VisiSocial</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.5.0/css/all.min.css">    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.9.0/styles/atom-one-dark.min.css">
    <link href="/stylesheets/visisocial.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #7c6cff;
            --primary-light: #9d7bff;
            --primary-dark: #5b4fe0;
            --secondary: #9d7bff;
            --accent: #34e3ff;
            --success: #2dd4a8;
            --warning: #f6b24a;
            --danger: #ff5d6c;
            --dark: #0a0a16;
            --darker: #06060e;
            --light: #ECECF6;
            --muted: #9a9ab6;
            --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            --glass-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 60px rgba(124,108,255,0.32);
            --shadow-soft: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: var(--darker);
            color: var(--light);
            line-height: 1.7;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .docs-bg {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: -1;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
            animation: float 25s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg); }
            33% { transform: translate(30px, -20px) rotate(120deg); }
            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 30px) rotate(240deg); }
        }

        .docs-layout {
            display: flex;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding-top: 80px;
        }

        /* Sidebar */
        .docs-sidebar {
            width: 280px;
            position: fixed;
            left: 0;
            top: 80px;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .docs-sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }

        .docs-sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: transparent;
        }

        .docs-sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .sidebar-section {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .sidebar-nav {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .sidebar-nav li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .sidebar-nav a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .sidebar-nav a:hover {
            color: var(--light);
            background: var(--glass);
        }

        .sidebar-nav a.active {
            color: var(--light);
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-light);
        }

        .sidebar-nav a i {
            color: var(--primary-light);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .sidebar-toggle {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 2rem;
            left: 2rem;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
            z-index: 101;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        .docs-main {
            flex: 1;
            margin-left: 280px;
            padding: 2rem 3rem 4rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
        }

        .docs-header {
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            animation: fadeInDown 0.8s ease;
        }

        .docs-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
            animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        .docs-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-light) 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .docs-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .version-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: #86efac;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .section {
            background: var(--glass);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease 0.2s backwards;
        }

        .section:hover {
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--light);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .section h2 i {
            color: var(--primary-light);
        }

        .section h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-light);
            margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .section p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Endpoint Card */
        .endpoint-card {
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .endpoint-card:hover {
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.6);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .endpoint-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .method-badge {
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .method-get {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            color: #86efac;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        }

        .method-post {
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
            color: #67e8f9;
            border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
        }

        .method-put {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
            color: #fcd34d;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }

        .method-delete {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        .endpoint-path {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--light);
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-light);
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 200px;
        }

        .endpoint-description {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Code Block */
        .code-block {
            position: relative;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .code-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        .code-language {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .code-copy {
            background: var(--glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--light);
            padding: 0.375rem 0.875rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .code-copy:hover {
            background: var(--glass-hover);
            border-color: var(--primary-light);
        }

        .code-copy.copied {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--success);
            color: var(--success);
        }

        pre {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        pre::-webkit-scrollbar {
            height: 8px;
        }

        pre::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        pre::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        code {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
        }

        .inline-code {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
            color: var(--primary-light);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        /* Parameter Table */
        .param-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 0;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .param-table th {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .param-table td {
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.4);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .param-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .param-table tr:hover td {
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.6);
        }

        .param-name {
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            color: var(--light);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .param-type {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
            color: #67e8f9;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .param-required {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-left: 0.5rem;
        }

        .param-optional {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
            background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
            color: var(--muted);
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-left: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* Response Example */
        .response-example {
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .response-status {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .status-200 {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            color: #86efac;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        }

        .status-400 {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
            color: #fcd34d;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }

        .status-401 {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }

        /* Alert Box */
        .alert-box {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-left: 4px solid;
        }

        .alert-info {
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--accent);
        }

        .alert-info h4 {
            color: #67e8f9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .alert-warning {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--warning);
        }

        .alert-warning h4 {
            color: #fcd34d;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .alert-box p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        /* Quick Links */
        .quick-links {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .quick-link-card {
            padding: 2rem;
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: block;
        }

        .quick-link-card:hover {
            background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.6);
            border-color: var(--primary-light);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .quick-link-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: white;
        }

        .quick-link-card h3 {
            color: var(--light);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .quick-link-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .back-to-top {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 2rem;
            right: 2rem;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .back-to-top.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: all;
        }

        .back-to-top:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .docs-sidebar {
                transform: translateX(-100%);
            }

            .docs-sidebar.open {
                transform: translateX(0);
            }

            .docs-main {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            .sidebar-toggle {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .docs-main {
                padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            }

            .docs-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 2rem;
            }

            .endpoint-header {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .endpoint-path {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .docs-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }

            .back-to-top {
                width: 50px;
                height: 50px;
                bottom: 1.5rem;
                right: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="docs-bg"></div>
        <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <div class="docs-layout">
        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <aside class="docs-sidebar" id="sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-section">
                <div class="sidebar-title">Getting Started</div>
                <ul class="sidebar-nav">
                    <li><a href="#introduction" class="active"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Introduction</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#authentication"><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Authentication</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#rate-limits"><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt"></i> Rate Limits</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#errors"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Error Handling</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="sidebar-section">
                <div class="sidebar-title">Endpoints</div>
                <ul class="sidebar-nav">
                    <li><a href="#user-profile"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> User Profile</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#personality"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i> Personality Analysis</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#insights"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Insights</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#export"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Data Export</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="sidebar-section">
                <div class="sidebar-title">Resources</div>
                <ul class="sidebar-nav">
                    <li><a href="#sdks"><i class="fas fa-code"></i> SDKs & Libraries</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#examples"><i class="fas fa-file-code"></i> Code Examples</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#changelog"><i class="fas fa-history"></i> Changelog</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <main class="docs-main">
            <header class="docs-header">
                <div class="docs-icon">
                    <i class="fas fa-book"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="docs-title">API Documentation</h1>
                <p class="docs-subtitle">
                    Comprehensive guide to integrating with the VisiSocial API
                </p>
                <div class="version-badge">
                    <i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i>
                    <span>Version 2.0.0</span>
                </div>
            </header>

            <!-- Introduction -->
            <section id="introduction" class="section">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    Welcome to the VisiSocial API documentation. Our API allows you to programmatically access personality analysis, user insights, and data export features. All endpoints use REST principles and return JSON responses.
                </p>
                
                <div class="alert-box alert-info">
                    <h4><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> Base URL</h4>
                    <p>All API requests should be made to: <code class="inline-code">https://api.visisocial.com/v2</code></p>
                </div>

                <h3>Quick Start</h3>
                <div class="quick-links">
                    <a href="#authentication" class="quick-link-card">
                        <div class="quick-link-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-key"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Authentication</h3>
                        <p>Learn how to authenticate your API requests</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#user-profile" class="quick-link-card">
                        <div class="quick-link-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>First Request</h3>
                        <p>Make your first API call to get user data</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#examples" class="quick-link-card">
                        <div class="quick-link-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-file-code"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Examples</h3>
                        <p>Browse complete code examples</p>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Authentication -->
            <section id="authentication" class="section">
                <h2><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Authentication</h2>
                <p>
                    All API requests require authentication using an access token. Include your token in the <code class="inline-code">Authorization</code> header of each request.
                </p>

                <h3>Getting Your API Token</h3>
                <p>
                    You can generate an API token from your dashboard settings. Navigate to Settings → API → Generate New Token.
                </p>

                <div class="code-block">
                    <div class="code-header">
                        <span class="code-language">HTTP Request</span>
                        <button class="code-copy" onclick="copyCode(this)">
                            <i class="fas fa-copy"></i>
                            <span>Copy</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <pre><code>GET /api/profile HTTP/1.1
Host: api.visisocial.com
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
